1428
01:05:06.220 --> 01:05:07.760
And it's very, very good.
而且非常非常美味。

1429
01:05:07.920 --> 01:05:09.680
And it's always, the soup is different.
而且每次的汤都不一样。

1430
01:05:09.680 --> 01:05:15.080
It's been, I remember very distinctly, there was a vegetable and another time a cream of potato.
我记得很清楚，有一次是蔬菜汤，还有一次是奶油土豆汤。

1431
01:05:15.620 --> 01:05:21.180
I had a dream after I saw The Matrix that I could, you know, that I was, like, a badass with Keanu.
我在看完《黑客帝国》后做过一个梦，梦见自己，你知道的，梦见自己和基努一起成了个女汉子。

1432
01:05:21.460 --> 01:05:24.100
And I was, like, I could do all that stuff.
我觉得，我能做到所有那些事。

1433
01:05:24.280 --> 01:05:25.880
Like, I could fly a helicopter.
就像，我会开直升机。

1434
01:05:26.300 --> 01:05:27.340
Not quite the same.
不太一样。

1435
01:05:27.340 --> 01:05:28.440
It's not quite the same.
这不太一样。

1436
01:05:28.480 --> 01:05:29.500
I don't know what that means.
我不知道那意味着什么。

1437
01:05:29.600 --> 01:05:31.100
And I also have never had it again.
而且我再也没有做过这个梦了。

1438
01:05:31.380 --> 01:05:32.020
I don't know.
我不知道。

1439
01:05:32.100 --> 01:05:33.740
I haven't had this dream in a long time.
我很长时间没做过这个梦了。

1440
01:05:34.300 --> 01:05:34.700
Amazing.
太神奇了。

1441
01:05:36.480 --> 01:05:36.880
Amazing.
太神奇了。

1442
01:05:39.680 --> 01:05:40.240
Where were we?
我们刚才聊到哪儿了？

1443
01:05:40.400 --> 01:05:40.940
I don't know.
我不知道。

1444
01:05:40.980 --> 01:05:42.080
It doesn't matter anymore.
这已经不重要了。

1445
01:05:42.260 --> 01:05:43.480
Brad Pitt makes you soup.
布拉德·皮特给你做汤。

1446
01:05:44.680 --> 01:05:45.200
Okay.
好吧。

1447
01:05:45.400 --> 01:05:48.340
We are at the point where now rumors are really spreading.
我们现在进展到了谣言四处流传的地步。

1448
01:05:48.740 --> 01:05:50.080
Oh, here we are.
哦，我们到了。

1449
01:05:50.220 --> 01:05:51.340
I know where we are, lady.
我知道我们在哪儿，女士。

1450
01:05:51.640 --> 01:05:52.800
We're in the conference room.
我们在会议室里。

1451
