If you go to 15 minutes 07, you'll see my hair awkwardly trying to be a ponytail, but it
如果你看到15分07秒，你会看到我的头发尴尬地想扎成一个马尾，但它

1496
01:07:53.820 --> 01:07:59.960
can't really be a ponytail because I decided to get bangs and it took forever to grow them
其实根本扎不成马尾，因为我决定留刘海，而把刘海留长花了太久

