01:09:48.560 --> 01:09:53.000
We had a fan question from Renata P from Rio de Janeiro, Brazil.
我们收到了来自巴西里约热内卢的雷娜塔·P的粉丝提问。

1537
01:09:53.840 --> 01:10:00.000
What are your thoughts about Jim's revelation to the whole office that the rumor about Pam being pregnant was actually true?
