01:10:04.060 --> 01:10:10.480
But in re-watching the scene yesterday, I was like, hey, maybe he should have had a conversation with Pam before telling everyone.
但昨天重看这一幕时，我在想，嘿，也许他在告诉大家之前，应该先和帕姆商量一下。

