And he literally is like, I've got this.
而他简直就像是在说，这事我搞得定。

1603
01:13:06.980 --> 01:13:09.260
And Pam is like, Michael, please don't.
帕姆则劝他，迈克尔，求你别这样。

1604
01:13:09.420 --> 01:13:12.800
Michael picks up the phone and says, hey, what up, Cynthia?
迈克尔拿起电话说，嘿，怎么了，辛西娅？

1605
01:13:14.780 --> 01:13:17.120
