01:16:50.570 --> 01:16:51.630
What if one day...
万一有一天……

1686
01:16:51.630 --> 01:16:52.250
You scared the crap out of me.
你把我吓死了。

1687
01:16:52.250 --> 01:16:52.550
I'm sorry.
对不起。

1688
01:16:52.710 --> 01:16:53.570
I'm having a dream.
我在做梦呢。

1689
01:16:53.650 --> 01:16:55.230
And I'm so sorry for anyone listening.
我对听节目的所有人感到非常抱歉。

1690
01:16:55.450 --> 01:16:57.250
I probably then scared you.
我可能把你们也吓到了。

1691
01:16:58.150 --> 01:17:05.910
What if one day we are doing office ladies and we get some soup delivered and it's from Brad Pitt?
万一有一天我们在录制办公室女郎时，有人送来了汤，而且是布拉德·皮特送的呢？

1692
01:17:06.750 --> 01:17:07.610
Come on.
拜托。

1693
01:17:07.830 --> 01:17:08.410
Could that happen?
这可能发生吗？

1694
01:17:08.410 --> 01:17:09.110
And you know what?
而且你知道吗？

1695
01:17:09.270 --> 01:17:10.470
Guess who's going to deliver it?
猜猜谁会来送外卖？

1696
01:17:10.990 --> 01:17:11.510
Keanu.
基努。

1697
01:17:13.110 --> 01:17:16.170
If Keanu Reeves delivered soup made by Brad Pitt.
如果基努·里维斯送来了布拉德·皮特做的汤。

1698
01:17:16.370 --> 01:17:23.390
And then all of a sudden Idris Elba is going to like bring some music into it and we're going to just have like a soup eating party.
然后伊德里斯·艾尔巴突然要加入一些音乐，然后我们就会举办一场喝汤派对。

1699
01:17:24.250 --> 01:17:25.590
What has just happened?
刚刚发生什么了？

1700
01:17:25.850 --> 01:17:26.530
I don't know.
我不知道。

1701
01:17:27.270 --> 01:17:29.890
Well, save it for nifty fifties.
好吧，留着以后在“精彩五十年代”再聊吧。

1702
01:17:31.210 --> 01:17:32.250
Musical review.
音乐回顾节目。

1703
01:17:32.810 --> 01:17:35.810
And you guys, we hope you have a fantastic week.
还有大家，我们希望你们能有一个美妙的一周。

1704
01:17:36.010 --> 01:17:42.750
Once again, thank you to Randy Cordray, Max Carver, and all of you guys for sending in your questions and your comments.
再次感谢兰迪·科德雷、马克斯·卡弗，以及所有发来问题和评论的朋友们。

1705
01:17:42.930 --> 01:17:44.070
We hope you have a great week.
我们希望你们过个愉快的一周。

1706
01:17:44.230 --> 01:17:44.690
We love you.
我们爱你们。

1707
01:17:49.640 --> 01:17:52.300
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies Second Drink.
感谢收听《办公室女士》番外篇。

1708
01:17:52.540 --> 01:17:56.220
This episode was initially created in collaboration with Earwolf.
本期节目最初是与 Earwolf 合作制作的。

1709
01:17:56.220 --> 01:18:01.340
Office Ladies is a presentation of Odyssey and is produced by Jenna Fisher and Angela Kinsey.
《办公室女士》是 Odyssey 推出的节目，由詹娜·费舍尔和安吉拉·金西制作。

1710
01:18:01.520 --> 01:18:03.620
Our senior producer is Matt Beagle.
我们的高级制作人是马特·比格尔。

1711
01:18:03.780 --> 01:18:06.720
Our second drinks episodes are produced by Molly Nugent.
我们的番外篇由莫莉·纽金特制作。

1712
01:18:07.040 --> 01:18:08.920
Our audio engineer is Sam Kiefer.
我们的音频工程师是萨姆·基弗。

1713
01:18:09.180 --> 01:18:11.740
Odyssey's executive producer is Leah Reese Dennis.
Odyssey 的执行制作人是莉亚·里斯·丹尼斯。

1714
01:18:12.180 --> 01:18:14.980
Office Ladies was mixed and mastered by Bill Schultz.
《办公室女士》由比尔·舒尔茨进行混音和母带处理。

1715
01:18:14.980 --> 01:18:17.940
Our theme song is Ruppertree by Creed Bratton.
我们的主题曲是克里德·布拉顿的《Ruppertree》。

1716
01:18:18.160 --> 01:18:18.580
We'll see you next time.
我们下期再见。
